sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as UI / Strategy / Agent
    participant Intake as Intent Intake
    participant Risk as RiskEngine
    participant OMS as OMS
    participant Outbox as Durable Outbox
    participant EGW as Execution Gateway
    participant Broker as Broker API
    participant Recon as Reconciliation

    Client->>Intake: Submit typed order intent
    Intake->>Risk: Evaluate policy and exposure
    Risk-->>Intake: Approve / reject with evidence
    alt Rejected
        Intake-->>Client: Rejection reason
    else Approved
        Intake->>OMS: Create authorized order
        OMS->>Outbox: Persist command and idempotency key
        Outbox->>EGW: Dispatch broker command
        EGW->>Broker: Submit order
        Broker-->>EGW: Acknowledgement or timeout
        EGW-->>OMS: Transport result (not fill proof)
        OMS->>Recon: Reconcile broker order state
        Recon->>Broker: Query order, fills and positions
        Broker-->>Recon: Authoritative broker state
        Recon-->>OMS: Reconciled state and discrepancies
        OMS-->>Client: Updated order projection
    end
